---
layout: base.njk
title: Gutter Tips & Guides | Blue River Gutters Blog
description: Expert advice on gutters, drainage, and home protection from North Alabama's trusted gutter company. Tips for homeowners in Huntsville, Madison, Decatur, and beyond.
permalink: /blog/
---

{# Breadcrumbs #}
<nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
  <div class="container">
    <ol class="breadcrumb-list">
      <li><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">Home</a></li>
      <li aria-current="page">Blog</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</nav>

{# Page Header #}
<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Gutter Tips & Guides</h1>
    <p>Expert advice on gutters, drainage, and protecting your North Alabama home.</p>
  </div>
</header>

{# Blog Posts Grid #}
<section class="blog-listing">
  <div class="container">
    
    {%- set blogPosts = collections.blog | reverse -%}
    
    {% if blogPosts.length > 0 %}
    <div class="blog-grid">
      {% for post in blogPosts %}
      <article class="blog-card">
        {% if post.data.featured_image %}
        <a href="{{ post.url | url }}" class="blog-card-image">
          <img src="{{ post.data.featured_image }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}" loading="lazy">
        </a>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="blog-card-content">
          {% if post.data.category %}
          <span class="blog-card-category">{{ post.data.category }}</span>
          {% endif %}
          <h2><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
          <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          <div class="blog-card-meta">
            {% if post.data.publish_date %}<time>{{ post.data.publish_date }}</time>{% endif %}
            {% if post.data.read_time %}<span>{{ post.data.read_time }} min read</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p class="no-posts">New content coming soon! Check back for tips on gutters, drainage, and home protection.</p>
    {% endif %}
    
  </div>
</section>

{# CTA #}
<section class="cta">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Questions About Your Gutters?</h2>
    <p>We're here to help. Free estimates for homeowners across North Alabama.</p>
    <a href="https://BlueRiverGutters.as.me/" class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Free Estimate</a>
    <p class="cta-phone"><a href="tel:2566166760">📞 (256) 616-6760</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.page-header {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--white);
  padding: 3rem 0;
  text-align: center;
}

.page-header h1 {
  color: var(--white);
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.page-header p {
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  margin: 0;
}

.blog-listing {
  padding: 4rem 0;
  background: var(--cream);
}

.blog-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
  gap: 2rem;
}

.blog-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: 8px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
}

.blog-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
}

.blog-card-image img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 200px;
  object-fit: cover;
  display: block;
}

.blog-card-content {
  padding: 1.5rem;
}

.blog-card-category {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--red);
  color: var(--white);
  padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
  border-radius: 3px;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}

.blog-card h2 {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  line-height: 1.3;
}

.blog-card h2 a {
  color: var(--navy);
  text-decoration: none;
}

.blog-card h2 a:hover {
  color: var(--red);
}

.blog-card p {
  color: var(--gray);
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.blog-card-meta {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1rem;
  color: var(--gray);
  font-size: 0.8rem;
}

.no-posts {
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--gray);
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  padding: 2rem;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .blog-listing {
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  
  .blog-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
